      "key": "lead",
      "type": "lead",
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "text": "**synthwerk-widgets** holds the embeddable AI chat and vision widgets for [synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk). The rewrite is planned. Until then, `main` holds a README. It holds it well."
    },
    {
      "key": "what",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "THE SHORT VERSION",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "One loader element",
          "text": "One loader element puts a launcher on the page. The widget app runs in an isolated iframe."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Desktop and mobile",
          "text": "Floating button on desktop, bottom sheet on mobile."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Studio settings",
          "text": "Position, theme and language come from studio settings."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Signed-in users only",
          "text": "Logged-out visitors see a sign-in prompt."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "startnotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHAT YOU GET",
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Nothing to install",
          "text": "There is nothing to install, build or run yet. This is the honest quick start."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "hownotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHO MEETS WHOM",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Three services",
          "text": "The widget calls three services: `synthwerk-llm`, `synthwerk-vision` and `synthwerk-identity`"
        },
        {
          "lead": "The host page",
          "text": "The host page only meets the loader element. The iframe keeps the rest away from it."
        }
      ]
    },
